# ADU bytes: the 7 byte MBAP header (transaction id, protocol id, length, unit id), then the PDU.
# Copied from the <raw> element of the test case "Write Extended Registers Request File Record" in fixtures/modbus/upstream/tcp/ParserSerializerTestsuite.xml (Apache PLC4X v1.0.0, commit ea229918); a test re-derives it from that file.
# Transaction 10, protocol id 0, length 12 (unit id plus 11 PDU bytes), unit id 1 (0x01). Function 0x15 (21, write file record; upstream calls it write extended registers) request: byte count 9. Outside the alpha set, so the PDU layer refuses it.
00 0A 00 00 00 0C 01 15 09 06 00 02 00 00 00 01 00 08
